### Schema Example

```json
{
  "chat_context": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "How do I deploy to Kubernetes?",
      "timestamp": "2026-02-27T10:30:00Z"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can deploy using kubectl apply...",
      "timestamp": "2026-02-27T10:30:02Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

